          "order": 4,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "ua! mathuaw thuini mashtay uka shawashawan, indahipuan ihu thaithuy.",
          "chineseText": "對啊！今天大家都會很忙，你要幫忙大家。",
